  "releaseNotes": "Logger.GetPdfAuditTrail drops the optional maxRows parameter introduced in 1.0.107:\n\t\t\tthe cap silently truncated the user's chosen date range (newest rows kept, older\n\t\t\tones dropped without any indication), so the PDF no longer matched the grid it was\n\t\t\texported from. The export is bounded by the caller's server-enforced date-range\n\t\t\tguardrails instead. Callers passing maxRows must simply remove the argument.",
